# Hybrid Monitor LUT
# Profile  : ARRI LogC3 (EI800)
# Cameras  : Alexa Mini, Alexa Mini LF, Alexa 35, Amira
# Input    : ARRI LogC3 (EI800) log / ARRI Wide Gamut 3
# Output   : Rec.709 base + narrow exposure tracer overlays
# Generator: hybrid_monitor_lut.py
#
# Base transform pipeline:
#   Log decode  →  ARRI Wide Gamut 3 → Rec.709 matrix  →  Rec.709 OETF
#
# Overlay zones (thin tracers over Rec.709 base):
#   #ef4444     white_clip      log 0.750 – 1.000
#   #eab308     +2 stops        log 0.531 – 0.541
#   #d946ef     +1 stops        log 0.458 – 0.468
#   #22c55e     +0 stops        log 0.386 – 0.396
#   #06b6d4     -1 stops        log 0.317 – 0.327
#   #3b82f6     -2 stops        log 0.253 – 0.261
#   #6366f1     black_clip      log 0.000 – 0.100
#   All other levels → standard Rec.709 color (no tracer)
#
